This dataset is a 10-row sample from GermanQuAD.

Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/deepset/germanquad
Authors: Timo Moller, Julian Risch, Malte Pietsch et al. (deepset.ai)
Paper: "GermanQuAD and GermanDPR: Improving Non-English Question Answering and Passage Retrieval" (2021)
